cx-items.tsv is generated by packaging/data/generate_cx_ids.py from two sources, both Path of
Exile 2's own data, owned by Grinding Gear Games.

The metadata id and English name of every base item come from the game's base item table
(base_items.json) as exported by RePoE for PoE2 at https://repoe-fork.github.io/poe2/
(https://github.com/repoe-fork/repoe-fork), fetched 2026-09-23. RePoE's code is distributed under
the MIT License, and its license adds: "Contents of generated files (all files in the `data`
directory) are owned by Grinding Gear Games and shall not be used or published without being in
accordance with their terms of use."

